Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard: outdoor weather for the house location

/api/history now includes the location from the OpenDTU time settings
(rounded to ~1 km); the dashboard shows the current outdoor temperature,
weather icon and description, feels-like temperature and wind from Open-Meteo
(fetched by the browser, cached 15 min), or a hint where to set the location.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EySGZ7zzCqzbQeGccwYzek
